            "pages": {
              "end": 36,
              "start": 36
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice BREYER, justice Breyer questioned whether a six\u2011month delay might be too late and how other circuits handle such delays."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "71980649e42dab6a81b31ab164899fb8c80c7f3a9f6f2bf7be75b1c1ef6ee4bf",
