            "pages": {
              "end": 40,
              "start": 40
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Scalia asked how the petitioner\u2019s argument fits with the rule that a mandate cannot be recalled."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice STEVENS",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "71980649e42dab6a81b31ab164899fb8c80c7f3a9f6f2bf7be75b1c1ef6ee4bf",
